            name: "create-function",
            aliases: [],
            description: Some("Creates a CloudFront function. To create a function, you provide the function code and some configuration information about the function. The response contains an Amazon Resource Name (ARN) that uniquely identifies the function. When you create a function, it\'s in the DEVELOPMENT stage. In this stage, you can test the function with TestFunction, and update it with UpdateFunction. When you\'re ready to use your function with a CloudFront distribution, use PublishFunction to copy the function from the DEVELOPMENT stage to LIVE. When it\'s live, you can attach the function to a distribution\'s cache behavior, using the function\'s ARN"),
